    "title": "Domestic battery investigation leads to discovery of drugs, guns near Rochester - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Capitol City Now ,\n1 days ago ROCHESTER, Ill. (CAPITOL CITY NOW) – Investigators say a domestic battery investigation led to the alleged discovery this week of 18 guns in one home, along with some drugs. The Sangamon County Sheriffs Department says it started Sunday evening around 6:30 p.m. at a home on Lake Services Road in Rochester. Read full article\n1",
